  "description": "Split Block Bloom Filter (Parquet SBBF) implementation with a generic-key facade. AVX2 and ARM NEON accelerated with a scalar fallback. Suitable both for reading and writing Parquet-format bloom filters and for in-process use over arbitrary key types via IHash64<T>. Targets netstandard2.0, net8.0, and net10.0.",
